      "content": "This is a significant operational shift, and I understand the need for stability in the face of public scrutiny. Transitioning to a rule-based system will certainly bring predictability, which should help restore advertiser confidence. Please let me know what resources or data I can provide to assist in the migration process over the next few days.",
